# Connect clinical application studies to the concrete TVB neural-mass model that
# implements the node dynamics they used, so the clinical knowledge graph reaches
# runnable (workspace-addable) models. Layered on top of tvb-o-clinical.ttl.
@prefix tvbo: <https://w3id.org/tvbo/> .
@prefix tvbc: <https://w3id.org/tvbo/clinical/> .

tvbc:study-Yang2015 tvbc:usesNodeDynamics tvbo:ReducedWongWang .
tvbc:study-Mana2023 tvbc:usesNodeDynamics tvbo:SupHopf .
